        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kitchen cupboard, front profile solid wood, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kitchen cupboard, front profile solid wood, at plant
na;
UUID: 2883c861-67ee-3b68-9635-4a6008f981d2
This data set includes the basic structure of the kitchen cupboards and the front cover (solid wood) per m3. The inventory bases on a kitchen with a cupboard volume of 3.36 m3. Screws and hinges are considered proportionally. The countertop, sink, waste system and cooker hood are not included. Linked to updated LCI of three layered laminated boards from Ecoinvent data v3.2 for KBOB recommendation 2016.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2883c861-67ee-3b68-9635-4a6008f981d2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
